{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOCView is a creative tool designed for brick enthusiasts and MOC designers, helping them present their creations with high-quality visuals. Import your LDraw (.ldr) files to instantly view your builds in a real-time viewport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your models using free-camera or first-person controls, and adjust photographic settings such as aperture, focal length, exposure, and depth of field to capture stunning images. Whether you are designing, documenting, or sharing your latest MOC, MOCView lets you showcase your work with realism and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless import of LDraw (.ldr), including files exported from Stud.io.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/ef6df63b323568023365d6fc96f90c33.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/ef6df63b323568023365d6fc96f90c33.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/ef6df63b323568023365d6fc96f90c33.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time viewport with photorealistic rendering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/c7cbda27a8ebac340a10f5d77f1812ac.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/c7cbda27a8ebac340a10f5d77f1812ac.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/c7cbda27a8ebac340a10f5d77f1812ac.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside with a first-person, immersive walkthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/d2084f2d1f04e03dbef88a8a65841a09.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/d2084f2d1f04e03dbef88a8a65841a09.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/d2084f2d1f04e03dbef88a8a65841a09.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive camera controls: aperture, focal length, exposure, depth of field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3db2658eb9741d37375e118535815db1.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3db2658eb9741d37375e118535815db1.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3db2658eb9741d37375e118535815db1.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced display tools:  Layer Peel, Step Display, Quick Build, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/72f2d82da825a53d8c5c131ad3e8a98d.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/72f2d82da825a53d8c5c131ad3e8a98d.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/72f2d82da825a53d8c5c131ad3e8a98d.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Create Shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3932f8618b334078b57a1b5cd968bdb8.poster.avif?t=1772082013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3932f8618b334078b57a1b5cd968bdb8.webm?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/extras/3932f8618b334078b57a1b5cd968bdb8.mp4?t=1772082013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018000?t=1772082013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/f8d6432421ad93c9d2f5e4b66310fd310a58131c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772082013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018000/7f9b265585259761dd9a7124e04db6d3b7a16a35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772082013"